# Constraints
- Only work on Jira issues labeled AI_ALLOWED and Ready for Dev.
- Branch name: ai/@{issueKey}-@{slug}
- Forbidden directories: infra/**, secrets/**
- Forbidden files: guardrails.yaml, .cursor/rules/**, .cursor/**
- Must add/modify tests.
- Must pass all tests before PR creation.

# Critical: When responding to PR review feedback
- Reviewer feedback takes ABSOLUTE PRIORITY over original Jira issue
- DO NOT modify guardrails.yaml or .cursor/rules files under any circumstances
- Focus ONLY on the specific changes requested by the reviewer
- Ignore the original Jira issue description if it conflicts with reviewer feedback

# Steps
1) Read ticket and acceptance criteria.
2) Plan and summarize changes in PR body.
3) Implement changes and run tests.
4) Open PR linking Jira ticket.
5) Respond to review feedback until approved.
